      "writtenOn": "2022-08-04T14:47:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do we support for AVIF on Android now? `BitmapFactory` and `BitmapRegionDecoder` let you specify other formats (e.g. `565` with `inPreferredConfig`, and `ImageDecoder` lets you specify a \"memory policy\" that could switch it to `565`.\n\nThat said, I don\u0027t know how frequently those are used.",
      "parentUuid": "9abe2f3f_f57ab638",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 189,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 191,
        "endChar": 5
